function updateAim(){target=null;villageTarget=null;let best=touchMode?.19:.12;if(phase==='village'){for(const t of trainingTargets){if(!t.active||!t.g.visible||t.chosen)continue;const point=t.position;projected.copy(point).project(camera);const d=Math.hypot(projected.x*camera.aspect,projected.y);if(projected.z<1&&projected.z>0&&d<best&&point.distanceTo(player.position)<32){best=d;villageTarget=t}}return;}for(const g of goblins){if(g.hp<=0||g.escaped)continue;const point=g.m.position.clone().add(new V(0,1.22,0));projected.copy(point).project(camera);const d=Math.hypot(projected.x*camera.aspect,projected.y);if(projected.z<1&&projected.z>0&&d<best&&point.distanceTo(player.position)<75&&visibleThroughTrunks(point)){best=d;target=g;}}}
function updateTracking(dt){if(!charging||!lockedTarget||!upgradeState.leading)return;if(lockedTarget.hp<=0||lockedTarget.escaped||lockedTarget.m.position.distanceTo(player.position)>80||!visibleThroughTrunks(lockedTarget.m.position.clone().add(new V(0,1.2,0)))){lockedTarget=null;return;}const delta=leadPoint(lockedTarget,30+clamp(charge/drawDuration(),.2,1)*40).sub(player.position.clone().add(new V(0,1.6,0)));const desiredYaw=Math.atan2(delta.x,delta.z),turn=Math.atan2(Math.sin(desiredYaw-yaw),Math.cos(desiredYaw-yaw));yaw+=turn*(1-Math.exp(-dt*7));pitch=THREE.MathUtils.lerp(pitch,Math.atan2(delta.y,Math.hypot(delta.x,delta.z)),1-Math.exp(-dt*7));}
